l&acirc;u đời. Đặc biệt, tỉnh được mệnh danh l&agrave; \"qu&ecirc; hương năm tấn\" nhờ sản lượng l&uacute;a gạo dồi d&agrave;o.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://localhost:8088/api/tinymce/images/thai-binh-o-mien-nao-1_1764223285359_f4309423.jpg\" alt=\"thai-binh-o-mien-nao-1.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"vi-tri-dia-ly-cua-thai-binh\"><strong>Vị tr&iacute; địa l&yacute; của Th&aacute;i B&igrave;nh</strong></h2>\n<p>Th&aacute;i B&igrave;nh nằm trong v&ugrave;ng đồng bằng s&ocirc;ng Hồng, thuộc miền Bắc Việt Nam. Tỉnh c&oacute; vị tr&iacute; địa l&yacute; tiếp gi&aacute;p với nhiều khu vực quan trọng: ph&iacute;a Bắc gi&aacute;p Hải Dương, Hưng Y&ecirc;n v&agrave; Hải Ph&ograve;ng; ph&iacute;a Nam gi&aacute;p Nam Định; ph&iacute;a T&acirc;y gi&aacute;p H&agrave; Nam; ph&iacute;a Đ&ocirc;ng tiếp gi&aacute;p với vịnh Bắc Bộ.</p>\n<p>Với hệ thống s&ocirc;ng ng&ograve;i d&agrave;y đặc, gồm s&ocirc;ng Hồng, s&ocirc;ng Tr&agrave; L&yacute; v&agrave; s&ocirc;ng Luộc, Th&aacute;i B&igrave;nh c&oacute; điều kiện tự nhi&ecirc;n thuận lợi cho sản xuất n&ocirc;ng nghiệp. B&ecirc;n cạnh đ&oacute;, tỉnh c&ograve;n sở hữu đường bờ biển d&agrave;i khoảng 54km, tạo tiềm năng ph&aacute;t triển kinh tế biển.</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://localhost:8088/api/tinymce/images/thai-binh-o-mien-nao-2_1764223316884_0c874128.jpg\" alt=\"thai-binh-o-mien-nao-2.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\"></p>',NULL,NULL,4,5,32,7,'[0.041501343,0.06347411,-3.0874967E-4,-0.03364414,0.058501404,-0.012462235,-0.013355795,-0.045386896,-0.0397657,-0.022788264,0.004855526,0.06994124,0.058852233,-0.0053216154,0.01397375,-0.015827892,0.02264855,0.028414117,-0.06603504,-0.029660292,-0.0053020995,0.025138283,0.022756247,0.025696043,0.0045931945,-0.050317623,-0.037949886,0.028616622,0.011983607,-0.07432455,0.016733196,0.04508618,-0.042467255,0.031168576,0.035607398,0.050813343,0.02560879,-0.022410871,0.053808358,-0.06641484,-0.0076096607,0.0077658766,0.041738465,0.034927312,-0.03403227,-0.05667077,0.003607906