ave;o m&ugrave;a n&agrave;y.</div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">T&iacute;nh từ trung t&acirc;m thủ đ&ocirc; H&agrave; Nội đi TP Điện Bi&ecirc;n, th&igrave;&nbsp;<strong>từ H&agrave; Nội đi Điện Bi&ecirc;n tầm 456 kilomet</strong>, c&ograve;n&nbsp;h&agrave;nh tr&igrave;nh từ&nbsp;<strong>th&agrave;nh phố Hồ Ch&iacute; Minh đi Điện Bi&ecirc;n d&agrave;i khoảng 1946 km</strong>&nbsp;dọc qua c&aacute;c tỉnh, th&agrave;nh phố từ Bắc v&agrave;o Nam.</div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">Chặng đường kh&aacute; xa, tuy nhi&ecirc;n với&nbsp;<strong>sự ph&aacute;t triển của phương tiện giao th&ocirc;ng vấn đề đi lại kh&aacute; đơn giản bạn đừng lo lắng.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">Kh&aacute;ch du lịch tới Điện Bi&ecirc;n thường đi v&agrave;o th&aacute;ng 3 dương lịch v&igrave;&nbsp;<strong>thời điểm n&agrave;y c&ograve;n l&agrave; m&ugrave;a xu&acirc;n th&iacute;ch hợp ngắm rừng hoa ban</strong>. C&ograve;n th&aacute;ng 12 l&agrave;&nbsp;<strong>hoa d&atilde; quỳ nhuộm v&agrave;ng cả con đường.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">V&agrave;o m&ugrave;a h&egrave; th&igrave; c&oacute; c&aacute;nh đồng l&uacute;a v&agrave;ng ươm.&nbsp;<strong>T&ugrave;y v&agrave;o khung cảnh m&agrave; bạn muốn chi&ecirc;m ngưỡng để lựa chọn thời điểm</strong>.</div>',NULL,NULL,4,47,36,25,'[0.025838764,0.048228428,-0.01407315,-0.043681875,0.029612305,-0.013821214,-0.031236514,-0.007919096,-0.030538034,-0.0076340586,0.0029436918,0.07656119,0.07746003,-0.0242509,0.02093663,0.0038802892,0.034518626,0.033277065,-0.09012993,-0.03262931,-0.0020521977,0.026270857,0.026910635,-0.0012947988,0.0022025981,-0.045765776,-0.038070235,0.033412285,0.009868277,-0.065122396,0.015505581,0.041912068,-0.028453393,0.019298473,0.045073178,0.06333335,0.02511846,-0.029981319,0.02104803,-0.0724672,-0.00841973,-0.005394764,0.04834295,0.040426802,-0.03457796,-0.06487919,0.006016962,0.018912405,-0.040387314,0.030408153,0.015720878,8.750601E-4,-0.04020854,0.08095552,-0.050094236,0.013588456,-0.0280542,-0.046148002,0.0