15:31:01','2026-01-21 20:39:27',NULL,'Thành'),(20,'Tour Hà Nam','e7d453da-e314-4610-a882-0b70f9c5d8ae_blob',5000000,4000000,3000000,'Ô tô',NULL,'<p><strong>H&agrave; Nam</strong>&nbsp;l&agrave; một&nbsp;<a title=\"Tỉnh (Việt Nam)\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/T%E1%BB%89nh_(Vi%E1%BB%87t_Nam)\">tỉnh</a>&nbsp;cũ thuộc v&ugrave;ng&nbsp;<a title=\"Đồng bằng s&ocirc;ng Hồng\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C4%90%E1%BB%93ng_b%E1%BA%B1ng_s%C3%B4ng_H%E1%BB%93ng\">Đồng bằng s&ocirc;ng Hồng</a>,&nbsp;<a title=\"Việt Nam\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vi%E1%BB%87t_Nam\">Việt Nam</a>.</p>\n<p>Năm 2020, H&agrave; Nam l&agrave; đơn vị h&agrave;nh ch&iacute;nh&nbsp;<a title=\"Việt Nam\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vi%E1%BB%87t_Nam\">Việt Nam</a>&nbsp;đ&ocirc;ng thứ 45 về số d&acirc;n,&nbsp;<a title=\"Danh s&aacute;ch đơn vị h&agrave;nh ch&iacute;nh Việt Nam theo GRDP\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danh_s%C3%A1ch_%C4%91%C6%A1n_v%E1%BB%8B_h%C3%A0nh_ch%C3%ADnh_Vi%E1%BB%87t_Nam_theo_GRDP\">xếp thứ 44</a>&nbsp;về&nbsp;<a class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tổng sản phẩm tr&ecirc;n địa b&agrave;n (GRDP)\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/T%E1%BB%95ng_s%E1%BA%A3n_ph%E1%BA%A9m_tr%C3%AAn_%C4%91%E1%BB%8Ba_b%C3%A0n_(GRDP)\">Tổng sản phẩm tr&ecirc;n địa b&agrave;n (GRDP)</a>,&nbsp;<a title=\"Danh s&aacute;ch đơn vị h&agrave;nh ch&iacute;nh Việt Nam theo GRDP b&igrave;nh qu&acirc;n đầu người\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danh_s%C3%A1ch_%C4%91%C6%A1n_v%E1%BB%8B_h%C3%A0nh_ch%C3%ADnh_Vi%E1%BB%87t_Nam_theo_GRDP_b%C3%ACnh_qu%C3%A2n_%C4%91%E1%BA%A7u_ng%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Di\">xếp thứ 23</a>&nbsp;về&nbsp;<a class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tổng sản phẩm tr&ecirc;n địa b&agrave;n (GRDP)\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/T%E1%BB%95ng_s%E1%BA%A3n_ph%E1%BA%A9m_tr%C3%AAn_%C4%91%E1%BB%8Ba_b%C3%A0n_(GRDP)\">GRDP</a>&nbsp;b&igrave;nh qu&acirc;n đầu người,&nbsp;<a title=\"Danh s&aacute;ch đơn vị h&agrave;nh ch&iacute;nh Việt Nam theo GRDP\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danh_s%C3%A1ch_%C4%91%C6%A1n_v%E1%BB%8B_h%C3%A0nh_ch%C3%ADnh_Vi%E1%BB%87t_Nam_theo_GRDP\">đứng thứ s&aacute;u</a>&nbsp;về tốc độ tăng trưởng&nbsp;<a class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tổng sản phẩm tr&ecirc;n địa b&agrave;n (GRDP)\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/T%E1%BB%95ng_s%E1%BA%A3n_ph%E1%BA%A9m_tr%C3%AAn_%C4%91%E1%BB%8Ba_b%C3%A0n_(GRDP)\">GRDP</a>. Với 808.200 người d&acirc;n,<sup id=\"cite_ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/H%C3%A0_Nam_(t%E1%BB%89nh_Vi%E1%BB%87t_Nam)#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&nbsp;GRDP đạt 44.613 tỉ&nbsp;<a title=\"Đồng (đơn vị tiền tệ)\" href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C4%90%E1%BB%93ng_(%C4%91%C6%A1n_v%E1%BB%8B_ti%E1%BB%81n_t%E1%BB%87)\">Đồng</a>&nbsp;(tương ứng với 1,9376 tỉ USD), GRDP b&igrave;nh qu&acirc;n đầu người đạt 55,2 triệu đồng (tương ứng với 2.397 USD), tốc độ tăng trưởng GRDP đạt 7,02%.<sup id=\"cite_ref-:08_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki/H%C3%A0_Nam_(t%E1%BB%89nh_Vi%E1%BB%87t_Nam)#cite_note-:08-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Năm 2022, tốc độ tăng trưởng kinh tế của H&agrave; Nam đạt 10,82%, đứng thứ 3 trong khu vực đồng bằng s&ocirc;ng Hồng v&agrave; đứng thứ 12 to&agrave;n quốc.</p>',NULL,NULL,4,39,29,19,'[0.036111772,0.051044006,-0.032960474,-0.043591745,0.033502907,0.021423232,-0.006805245,-0.041813064,-0.025921028,-0.008050085,0.02540658,0.077696346,0.038979933,-0.0156336,0.05124039,0.0022988678,0.01858997,-0.048586786,-0.11048865,-0.035398774,-0.03275228,-0.0101345135,-0.00673148,0.016130386,0.008328923,-0.0362386,-0.068408065,0.04280238,-0.0056887525,-0.048703708,0.011215779,0.054154783,-0.023016114,0.025855409,-0.0018207387,0.04477002,0.006583261,-0.040962495,0.05486753,-0.06339524,-0.009524219,-0.025195802,0.022444937,0.039978825,-0.053465627,-0.05309423,0.031655874,-0.008677589,-0.029353816,0.0019393225,